    subject: "Should we keep sending these?",
    body: "<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" style=\"width:600px;max-width:600px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 40px rgba(15,23,42,0.08)\">\n        <tr><td style=\"height:6px;background:#2563eb;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2563eb,#4f46e5);font-size:0;line-height:0\">&nbsp;</td></tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:26px 40px 8px\">\n          <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\"><tr>\n            <td align=\"left\" style=\"font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-0.03em;color:#0f172a\">INDIBRICK</td>\n            <td align=\"right\" style=\"font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#94a3b8\">The Ecosystem</td>\n          </tr></table>\n        </td></tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:30px 40px 0;font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#2563eb\">Last one</div>\n          <h1 style=\"margin:16px 0 0;font-size:32px;line-height:1.1;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-0.025em;color:#0f172a\">Your call on what happens next.</h1>\n          <p style=\"margin:20px 0 0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.62;font-weight:400;color:#475569\">{{firstName}}, that's the end of what we had to say about MIRA, Vicinity, Midhurst Valley and the wider South Barrie corridor. Three ways forward, and one of them is doing nothing.</p>\n        </td></tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:24px 40px 0;font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif\">\n          <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\">\n            <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:12px\">\n              <a href=\"https://indibrick.ca/apply\" style=\"display:block;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px\">\n                <span style=\"display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a\">I'm ready to know my number</span>\n                <span style=\"display:block;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:400;color:#64748b;margin-top:3px\">Ten minutes, no credit impact to start, and a broker reviews it personally.</span>\n              </a>\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr><td style=\"padding-bottom:12px\">\n              <a href=\"https://indibrick.ca/contact\" style=\"display:block;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px\">\n                <span style=\"display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a\">I have questions first</span>\n                <span style=\"display:block;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:400;color:#64748b;margin-top:3px\">Fifteen minutes with an advisor. Bring the awkward questions.</span>\n              </a>\n            </td></tr>\n            <tr><td>\n              <a href=\"#\" style=\"display:block;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px\">\n                <span style=\"display:block;font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a\">Not this year</span>\n                <span style=\"display:block;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;font-weight:400;color:#64748b;margin-top:3px\">We'll stop the sequence and only send you a note when a new community launches in the corridor.</span>\n              </a>\n            </td></tr>\n          </table>\n        </td></tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:26px 40px 0;font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif\">\n          <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.62;font-weight:400;color:#475569\">If your timeline is a year or two out, that's genuinely fine. Register once, buy when it makes sense, and we'll keep the pricing sheets coming.</p>\n        </td></tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:30px 40px 0;font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif\">\n          <div style=\"border-top:1px solid #f1f5f9;padding-top:22px\">\n            <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a\">The IndiBrick Team</div>\n            <div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:400;color:#64748b;margin-top:2px\">Mortgages · Real estate · Legal · Wealth strategy</div>\n          </div>\n        </td></tr>\n        <tr><td style=\"padding:26px 40px 32px;font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif\">\n          <table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" style=\"background:#0f172a;border-radius:14px\"><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 26px\">\n            <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#ffffff\">INDIBRICK</div>\n            <div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;font-weight:400;color:#94a3b8;margin-top:10px\">60 Pippin Road, Unit 34, Vaughan, ON L4K 4M8 · indibrick.ca<br>Mortgages processed through Pineapple Financial · Lic #12830</div>\n            <div style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;font-weight:400;color:#64748b;margin-top:12px\">IndiBrick is not the builder. Pricing, floor plans and incentives are subject to change without notice.<br><a href=\"#\" style=\"color:#94a3b8;text-decoration:underline\">Unsubscribe</a> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href=\"#\" style=\"color:#94a3b8;text-decoration:underline\">Update preferences</a></div>\n          </td></tr></table>\n        </td></tr>\n      </table>",
